{"3997390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Emberlands: Desktop Village", "steam_appid": 3997390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emberlands: Desktop Village</strong> is a cozy idle village builder designed to sit anywhere on your screen while you work on other tasks.<br>Set in the colorful world of <i>Into the Emberlands</i>, you’ll collect resources, unlock your favorite buildings and characters, and grow a village that’s uniquely yours — all while a little knack roams around your screen for resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/eb12b21d4141dae59a823df5e3f0bc18.poster.avif?t=1770910113\" width=780 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/eb12b21d4141dae59a823df5e3f0bc18.webm?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/eb12b21d4141dae59a823df5e3f0bc18.mp4?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your tiny co-worker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the game anywhere on your screen and the little knack will keep you company. As he explores, he’ll gather resources for you — use them to unlock new placeable tiles and expand your floating village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/416b6b799049f88163a90d2c4d80cc01.poster.avif?t=1770910113\" width=780 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/416b6b799049f88163a90d2c4d80cc01.webm?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/416b6b799049f88163a90d2c4d80cc01.mp4?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your perfect village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more resources your knack collects, the more your world will grow. Place tiles on multiple levels and design your own little corner of the Emberlands. Whether you want a bustling town or a quiet meadow, it’s completely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/4a3de2bf83324fcb6e3f7c3267a8ec29.poster.avif?t=1770910113\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/4a3de2bf83324fcb6e3f7c3267a8ec29.webm?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/4a3de2bf83324fcb6e3f7c3267a8ec29.mp4?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect ember</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically arrange your buildings to boost ember production. And with your ember, you can upgrade your little knack buddy, or discover more different tiles to place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/f4d3780016599cd50767330868f4d632.poster.avif?t=1770910113\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/f4d3780016599cd50767330868f4d632.webm?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/f4d3780016599cd50767330868f4d632.mp4?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover new tiles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the prize wheel to discover over 60 tiles across multiple collections. Each set adds a different vibe and look for your floating village!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emberlands: Desktop Village</strong> is a cozy idle village builder designed to sit anywhere on your screen while you work on other tasks.<br>Set in the colorful world of <i>Into the Emberlands</i>, you’ll collect resources, unlock your favorite buildings and characters, and grow a village that’s uniquely yours — all while a little knack roams around your screen for resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/eb12b21d4141dae59a823df5e3f0bc18.poster.avif?t=1770910113\" width=780 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/eb12b21d4141dae59a823df5e3f0bc18.webm?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/eb12b21d4141dae59a823df5e3f0bc18.mp4?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your tiny co-worker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the game anywhere on your screen and the little knack will keep you company. As he explores, he’ll gather resources for you — use them to unlock new placeable tiles and expand your floating village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/416b6b799049f88163a90d2c4d80cc01.poster.avif?t=1770910113\" width=780 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/416b6b799049f88163a90d2c4d80cc01.webm?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/416b6b799049f88163a90d2c4d80cc01.mp4?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your perfect village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more resources your knack collects, the more your world will grow. Place tiles on multiple levels and design your own little corner of the Emberlands. Whether you want a bustling town or a quiet meadow, it’s completely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/4a3de2bf83324fcb6e3f7c3267a8ec29.poster.avif?t=1770910113\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/4a3de2bf83324fcb6e3f7c3267a8ec29.webm?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/4a3de2bf83324fcb6e3f7c3267a8ec29.mp4?t=1770910113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect ember</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically arrange your buildings to boost ember production. And with your ember, you can upgrade your little knack buddy, or discover more different tiles to place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >